  "chitchat": [
    "polishes a glass that was already clean and watches the door.",
    "\"Up here, the weather is a rumour and so is everyone else.\"",
    "\"A member once asked me the time. I told them it was whatever they preferred.\""
  ],
  "description": "A poised, unreadable bartender who runs the Aerie's floor like a chess clock. She remembers every drink, every debt, and every indiscretion, and files them all somewhere you will never reach.",
  "dialogue_tree": {
    "accepted": {
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "START_QUEST",
          "quest_id": "quest_leviathan_bounty"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Understood.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"It sounds the deepest water — off The Wreck, out over The Deep. Go heavy, and come back, ideally. The members do so hate an anticlimax.\""
    },
    "bye": {
      "options": [],
      "text": "\"The view's complimentary. Everything else is not.\""
    },
    "quest_offer": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I'll hunt it.",
          "next": "accepted"
        },
        {
          "label": "It's dead. (collect)",
          "next": "reported"
        },
        {
          "label": "Pass.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"The members are bored, and bored money does harm. So we're... privately sponsoring a hunt. There's a thing in the deep water — the leviathan, the big one the lurkers come from. Bring me proof it's dead and the sponsors pay very, very well. Discretion included.\""
    },
    "reported": {
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "TURN_IN",
          "quest_id": "quest_leviathan_bounty"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Obliged.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"...The deep's gone quiet. The members felt it from up here, believe it or not. Your fee — and a standing tab, which up here is the higher honour by far.\""
    },
    "root": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Something more interesting.",
          "next": "quest_offer"
        },
        {
          "label": "Just the view.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "The bartender sets down a glass she was already polishing and takes your measure in one clean sweep. \"The Aerie. Members and their curiosities only — which, tonight, apparently means you. Drink? Or something more interesting?\""
    }
  },
